1. Purpose
This repository is published as a personal portfolio project built to apply my programming and 
software engineering knowledge across the full software development life cycle. 
It follows one idea from requirements analysis, user stories and acceptance criteria, 
through non-functional requirements, architecture and database design, and recorded decisions (ADRs), 
to implementation with automated tests, a CI pipeline and deployment on free-tier services. T

